parately. Late fruit is stored in the cool room until the next morning.","token_count":85},{"alternates":[],"best_rank_by_intent":{"I1":2},"char_end":1398,"char_start":1276,"chunk_id":"Doc_07§4#1","citation":"Doc_07 §4","conflict_ids":[],"document_id":"Doc_07","evidence_id":"Doc_07§4#1","fused_score":0.031514,"hits":[{"bm25_rank":2,"dense_rank":5,"intent_id":"I1","query_id":"Q3","rank":2,"rerank_score":null,"retrieval_method":"hybrid_rrf","rrf_score":0.0315136476426799,"score":0.0315136476426799,"stale":false}],"intent_relevance":{},"label":"E2","section_id":"4","section_title":"Tool Shed","selected_for":["I1"],"source_path":"Doc_07_fixture_orchard.txt","supporting_intents":["I1"],"supporting_queries":["Q3"],"text":"Before leaving the shed, each worker must:\n1. Clean the blades.\n2. Hang every tool on its hook.\n3. Sign the tool register.","token_count":23},{"alternates":[],"best_rank_by_intent":{"I1":3},"char_end":409,"char_start":145,"chunk_id":"Doc_07§1#1","citation":"Doc_07 §1","conflict_ids":[],"document_id":"Doc_07","evidence_id":"Doc_07§1#1","fused_score":0.031498,"hits":[{"bm25_rank":3,"dense_rank":4,"intent_id":"I1","query_id":"Q3","rank":3,"rerank_score":null,"retrieval_method":"hybrid_rrf","rrf_score":0.03149801587301587,"score":0.03149801587301587,"stale":false}],"intent_relevance":{},"label":"E3","section_id":"1","section_title":"Planting Schedule","selected_for":["I1"],"source_path":"Doc_07_fixture_orchard.txt","supporting_intents":["I1"],"supporting_queries":["Q3"],"text":"Saplings in the fixture orchard are planted between the third and fifth week of the planting season. Each sapling receives 12 litres of water on the day it is planted.\n\nApproved sapling varieties:\n\n1. Red Fixture Apple\n\n2. Golden Fixture Pear\n\n3. Blue Fixture Plum","token_count":45},{"alternates":[],"best_rank_by_intent":{"I1":4},"char_end":925,"char_start":794,"chunk_id":"fixture_lighthouse_manual§3#1","citation":"fixture_lighthouse_manual §3","conflict_ids":[],"document_i